stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> QUEUED : POST generate-lessons (trừ quota)
  QUEUED --> RUNNING : worker claim WHERE status = QUEUED
  QUEUED --> CANCELLED : POST cancel
  RUNNING --> CANCELLED : POST cancel, worker dừng ở checkpoint
  RUNNING --> SUCCEEDED : có ít nhất 1 Lesson hợp lệ
  RUNNING --> FAILED : 0 Lesson hợp lệ, timeout, vượt trần chi phí
  FAILED --> QUEUED : BullMQ retry (tối đa 3) hoặc admin retry
  SUCCEEDED --> [*]
  CANCELLED --> [*]
